[8] Final readout
  The new useful lane is not 'perfect number implies obstruction' and not
  'mediant implies graph average'.  It is a labelled split:
    F_3: perfect-product planar seed 2/3 -> K_{2,3};
    F_4: first complete-bipartite K3,3 wall 3/4 -> K_{3,4};
    LRC14: unit-excess wall 3/41 -> K_{3,41};
    graph proof step: minor/subdivision transitivity, not averaging.
  This remains a POKE proof-interface hypothesis, not a proof of LRC14.
